<title>FINLAND: RAISION TEHTAAT 4-MTH PROFIT UP 81 PCT.</title>
<headline>RAISION TEHTAAT 4-MTH PROFIT UP 81 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to end-April,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax    69.4 vs 38.3</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   2.68 vs 1.25</p>
<p> Net sales					  1,542 vs 1,194</p>
<p> Operating profit				  72.4 vs 51.5</p>
<p>NOTE - The median of 10 analysts' forecasts for Finnish</p>
<p>food, chemicals and animal feed group Raision Tehtaat Oy's</p>
<p>profit before extras, tax had been 71 million markka in a 53-80</p>
<p>million markka range.</p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation     157.6 vs 124.2</p>
<p> Extraordinary items				nil vs 0.8 gain</p>
<p> Profit before reserves, taxes		 69.4 vs 39.1</p>
<p> Net profit					  43.8 vs 31.1</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    55.4 vs 51.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Raision Tehtaat Oy Ab.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
